# parse/pentry (id 64): entry phases after spill. PC 0 read text length at HS = A.PAY; PC 1 LEN, read
# HEAP_TOP; PC 2 HT, read FORMULA_TOP; PC 3 FT, call unpack (65); PC 4 read char 0; PC 5 dispatch:
# '=' formula (66), apostrophe text copy (70), empty (79 restore, blank), else constant (76).
# Note: weights/parse/pentry.md
input 65
